  This page outlines the key requirements and activities involved in introducing self-referral into breast diagnostic clinics through NHS 111 online within your organisation.</p><p class="nhsuk-body">Our onboarding readiness checklist provides an overview of the operational, clinical, technical and governance arrangements that will need to be considered as part of the onboarding process.</p><p class="nhsuk-body">The NHS 111 online team will work with participating organisations throughout onboarding to support local planning, implementation and go-live preparations.
